  "factor_name": "Low-Dispersion Volatility-Normalized Five-Day Relative Reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-I(low_dispersion_t) * (R5_i,t - median_i(R5_i,t)) / sigma20_i,t",
    "description": "Cross-sectional reversal of each asset's five-session return relative to the contemporaneous universe median, scaled by its trailing 20-session return volatility. The signal is active only when the lagged 252-session cross-asset average 20-day volatility dispersion is below its 25th percentile. All inputs are completed-session data and the percentile gate is shifted one session to prevent look-ahead. Positive values indicate expected next-session relative outperformance."
  },
